+The status is `DETERMINED_PROP6.4`, `DETERMINED_COMPLETE_US1`, and the
+`V_vectors` set is the singleton `[(3,7)]`. This is not a copied parent
+representative. The branch arithmetic in the frozen code (lines 151–194) is:
+
+* At source index 3, \(\delta_3=1/5\), \(P=21\), selected \(V_3=21\).
+  The nonzero option would require \(5\cdot21\le21\) and is impossible;
