+  partition is proved.
+* **Variable/ring map:** the child ring is \(k[X,Y]=k[\gamma,\pi]\), with
+  \(P'=\bar T_1^\psi(\sigma)\), \(Q'=\bar g(\sigma)\), and degrees 28,42.
+* **Prime label/derivative:** child primes and \(Y\)-derivatives are not
