+* **Merge-free/M-descent:** \(V'\) is the singleton own vector returned by the
+  first-support inversion, not copied parent \(V\). No free \(M\) or \(W\)
+  is inserted below level 2.
+* **Pole/interior:** every packet is classified by multiplicity relative to
+  the threshold 2 before the major continuation theorem is used.
+* **Depth:** the printed list ends at \(D'_1\); no finite cap or maximal sweep
+  substitutes for a theorem.
