+\[
+ \boxed{p'_2=\pi^5(\pi^3-c)^3.}
+\]
+
+Its four \(P'\)-root packets have reduced multiplicities \(5,3,3,3\).
+Since \(m'/d'_2=2\), their actual \(P'\)-root counts are
