+## 4. The unique printed fixed-list child pattern
+
+At \(D'_3\), Proposition 4.6 gives
+
+\[
+ P_3=V'_4d'_3/d'_4=7,qquad
+ Q_3=P_3(n'-M'_3)/d'_3=2.
